(2630560, 363863, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and focus.  Interesting take on abstract.  To be completely honest though, the props to highlight addiction don''t interest me at all, instead I find myself facinated with the top left-hand corner of the image with the green and white.  Been staring at that for awhile trying to figure out what it was.  I think using that stuff as the subject would appeal more (to me) in an abstract sense.</td>', 'Good lighting and focus.  Interesting take on abstract.  To be completely honest though, the props to highlight addiction don''t interest me at all, instead I find myself facinated with the top left-hand corner of the image with the green and white.  Been staring at that for awhile trying to figure out what it was.  I think using that stuff as the subject would appeal more (to me) in an abstract sense.', '2006-07-17 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630578, 364531, 45790, '<td valign="top">Obviously kiwi fruit, but the extreme USM (I guess) give it an unworldly and very abstract look. Nice!</td>', 'Obviously kiwi fruit, but the extreme USM (I guess) give it an unworldly and very abstract look. Nice!', '2006-07-17 16:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630630, 364819, 6179, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus. Actually alot out of focus.</td>', 'A little out of focus. Actually alot out of focus.', '2006-07-17 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630631, 364616, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, great focus and nice composition for the most part.  That said I find myself adjusting my window so I can crop out most of the left side of the screen.  That moves the attention to the main subject and leaves nothing to distract my eye.  I think it makes the image stronger, so I''d suggest a tighter crop, perhaps and inch out from the most bulbous portion of the onion.  I gave a 7 all the same.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, great focus and nice composition for the most part.  That said I find myself adjusting my window so I can crop out most of the left side of the screen.  That moves the attention to the main subject and leaves nothing to distract my eye.  I think it makes the image stronger, so I''d suggest a tighter crop, perhaps and inch out from the most bulbous portion of the onion.  I gave a 7 all the same.', '2006-07-17 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630635, 362575, 48739, '<td valign="top">i tried this on my honeymoon and i love it!! it is SOOO GOOD... nice capture</td>', 'i tried this on my honeymoon and i love it!! it is SOOO GOOD... nice capture', '2006-07-17 17:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630649, 364911, 17507, '<td valign="top">The idea is solid. If you could have controlled the lighting more - to isolate the highlights, or make some sort of shape out of them, or perhaps use a more diffuse light to soften the contrasts - I think this would be a lot stronger.</td>', 'The idea is solid. If you could have controlled the lighting more - to isolate the highlights, or make some sort of shape out of them, or perhaps use a more diffuse light to soften the contrasts - I think this would be a lot stronger.', '2006-07-17 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630653, 364770, 17507, '<td valign="top">the colors are great! I love the flowing color fields. the use of image area seems a bit awkward to me, though. for my eye, there is too much space below the kiwi and not enough at the top. the result is an appearance of over-verticality, almost like it''s been stretched. the control of focus and exposure are strong.</td>', 'the colors are great! I love the flowing color fields. the use of image area seems a bit awkward to me, though. for my eye, there is too much space below the kiwi and not enough at the top. the result is an appearance of over-verticality, almost like it''s been stretched. the control of focus and exposure are strong.', '2006-07-17 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630654, 364733, 54731, '<td valign="top">I thought about submitting a picture just like this but didn''t have time to set it up and shoot. It is good but I think you should have removed that piece that is sticking out because what makes this picture are the lines and that thing on top distracts our attention from them. I''ll give you a 7 anyways.</td>', 'I thought about submitting a picture just like this but didn''t have time to set it up and shoot. It is good but I think you should have removed that piece that is sticking out because what makes this picture are the lines and that thing on top distracts our attention from them. I''ll give you a 7 anyways.', '2006-07-17 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630657, 363154, 17507, '<td valign="top">hmm. i think this is one of those things that is perhaps more fun to eat than to look at.</td>', 'hmm. i think this is one of those things that is perhaps more fun to eat than to look at.', '2006-07-17 17:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630660, 362697, 54731, '<td valign="top">Funny but the lighting could be improve especially on the bottom, you could have made the whites whiter in PP.</td>', 'Funny but the lighting could be improve especially on the bottom, you could have made the whites whiter in PP.', '2006-07-17 17:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630662, 362043, 17507, '<td valign="top">i think this falls more in the category of ''still life'' than ''abstract.'' try to use a light source that will give you stronger contrast between highlight and shadow. this looks like it came from indirect windowlight - which is a great source of light, but placement, time of day, and nearby reflective surfaces all make a difference.</td>', 'i think this falls more in the category of ''still life'' than ''abstract.'' try to use a light source that will give you stronger contrast between highlight and shadow. this looks like it came from indirect windowlight - which is a great source of light, but placement, time of day, and nearby reflective surfaces all make a difference.', '2006-07-17 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630663, 364739, 17507, '<td valign="top">cool shapes and colors. contrast is a bit high for my tastes - pushes this away from photography toward graphic design.</td>', 'cool shapes and colors. contrast is a bit high for my tastes - pushes this away from photography toward graphic design.', '2006-07-17 17:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630665, 363798, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is quite weird. insofar as it is weird, it is interesting, but i''m not sure it''s the kind of thing i''d want to look at for very long...</td>', 'this is quite weird. insofar as it is weird, it is interesting, but i''m not sure it''s the kind of thing i''d want to look at for very long...', '2006-07-17 17:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630668, 364526, 17507, '<td valign="top">very surreal, technically and conceptually strong, lovely colors - but not what i would call abstract.</td>', 'very surreal, technically and conceptually strong, lovely colors - but not what i would call abstract.', '2006-07-17 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630669, 364592, 60370, '<td valign="top">The only things I don''t like are the shadows cast by the food and the onion seems dried out or something.  As for whether or not it''s "abstract enough" is just ridiculous for people to comment on.  There are SO many definitions of abstract and you portrayed one version of it.  Macro does NOT equal abstract...it is only a version.<br/>Your photo is unique, simple, colorful AND abstract.  I LOVE abstract work, I just can''t do it myself.<br/>I give you an 8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-28 01:37:10.</i></td>', 'The only things I don''t like are the shadows cast by the food and the onion seems dried out or something.  As for whether or not it''s "abstract enough" is just ridiculous for people to comment on.  There are SO many definitions of abstract and you portrayed one version of it.  Macro does NOT equal abstract...it is only a version.Your photo is unique, simple, colorful AND abstract.  I LOVE abstract work, I just can''t do it myself.I give you an 8.', '2006-07-17 17:41:08.000000', '2006-07-28 02:37:10.000000', 1),
(2630670, 364733, 17507, '<td valign="top">great choice of subject for this challenge. the DOF and lighting are great. not sure how i feel about the overhanging chunk of stem.</td>', 'great choice of subject for this challenge. the DOF and lighting are great. not sure how i feel about the overhanging chunk of stem.', '2006-07-17 17:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630672, 364070, 17507, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I can''t recognize this as food at all... it''s an interesting image, but I have no idea what it is!</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I can''t recognize this as food at all... it''s an interesting image, but I have no idea what it is!', '2006-07-17 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630679, 363060, 17507, '<td valign="top">great abstraction! <br/>the colors and shapes are lovely. i have two suggestions that you can take or leave as you please:<br/>- don''t feel married to the 3x2 format of your camera. in this case, i think there''s a bit at the top and a bit more at the bottom that could be cropped off. the seeds and the veins in the leaves are beautiful, but the top and bottom of the frame are nothing but blurred areas. possibly 5x7 or 4x3 would have suited you better.<br/>- IMHO, the importance of capturing a full tonal range (in most cases) cannot be overstated. you have lovely gradients and lighting, but virtually no white. especially with a solid white border, the image itself winds up looking dark and underarticulated. for this picture, possibly some dodging on the light areas circling the seeds would have added a bit of welcome ''pop.''<br/> <br/>good luck :)</td>', 'great abstraction! the colors and shapes are lovely. i have two suggestions that you can take or leave as you please:- don''t feel married to the 3x2 format of your camera. in this case, i think there''s a bit at the top and a bit more at the bottom that could be cropped off. the seeds and the veins in the leaves are beautiful, but the top and bottom of the frame are nothing but blurred areas. possibly 5x7 or 4x3 would have suited you better.- IMHO, the importance of capturing a full tonal range (in most cases) cannot be overstated. you have lovely gradients and lighting, but virtually no white. especially with a solid white border, the image itself winds up looking dark and underarticulated. for this picture, possibly some dodging on the light areas circling the seeds would have added a bit of welcome ''pop.'' good luck :)', '2006-07-17 17:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2630685, 364531, 17507, '<td valign="top">zowie. those looks like they''re made out of leather. <br/>The pixellation patterns you have created are fascinating</td>', 'zowie. those looks like they''re made out of leather. The pixellation patterns you have created are fascinating', '2006-07-17 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
