(2630927, 364242, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours seem earthy which is good in a way, however I feel its much too flat-looking and a bit dull. Needs more contrast I think. The shapes are good though, and the curves lead the eye nicely. It also looks like it''s had some kind of effect applied in post processing which I think detracts from the photo a bit. Not having seen the original (or knowing for sure that this isnt the original) I can''t say for certain though. Just my opinion :)</td>', 'The colours seem earthy which is good in a way, however I feel its much too flat-looking and a bit dull. Needs more contrast I think. The shapes are good though, and the curves lead the eye nicely. It also looks like it''s had some kind of effect applied in post processing which I think detracts from the photo a bit. Not having seen the original (or knowing for sure that this isnt the original) I can''t say for certain though. Just my opinion :)', '2006-07-17 19:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
