(2631832, 364491, 12750, '<td valign="top">It seems the background and the foreground don''t go together? Like the background is a print or display?  Interesting concept.</td>', 'It seems the background and the foreground don''t go together? Like the background is a print or display?  Interesting concept.', '2006-07-18 01:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
