(2633630, 364889, 42100, '<td valign="top">This abstract definitely fits into unrecognizable category, at least for me.  The colors and composition really make this a great abstract and a very strong contender in my book.  Great job!</td>', 'This abstract definitely fits into unrecognizable category, at least for me.  The colors and composition really make this a great abstract and a very strong contender in my book.  Great job!', '2006-07-18 17:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
