(2633702, 362916, 42100, '<td valign="top">I know this is an abstract challenge, but I''m continually being amazed by the quality of macros.  This is another great one with lots of detail.  Well done!</td>', 'I know this is an abstract challenge, but I''m continually being amazed by the quality of macros.  This is another great one with lots of detail.  Well done!', '2006-07-18 18:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
