(2634119, 364560, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  It''s literal, but works nicely as an abstract, if that makes sense.<br/>Do I like it?  Yes - visually quite pleasing.<br/>Technicals?  Very good - well lit, nice detail, good color.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  It''s literal, but works nicely as an abstract, if that makes sense.Do I like it?  Yes - visually quite pleasing.Technicals?  Very good - well lit, nice detail, good color.', '2006-07-18 21:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634123, 362916, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Perhaps more of a macro than an abstract.<br/>Do I like it?  Yep.  Nicely composed and an excellent macro.  Lighting is good as well.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Perhaps more of a macro than an abstract.Do I like it?  Yep.  Nicely composed and an excellent macro.  Lighting is good as well.', '2006-07-18 21:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634125, 364695, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Literal, but presents well as an abstract.<br/>Do I like it?  Quite like the effect and the lighting on the shell in particular.<br/>Technicals?  Good - pure black background is good.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Literal, but presents well as an abstract.Do I like it?  Quite like the effect and the lighting on the shell in particular.Technicals?  Good - pure black background is good.', '2006-07-18 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634128, 364920, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Perhaps a bit more of a close shot with good bokeh than an abstract.<br/>Do I like it?  Like the smile!<br/>Technicals?  About average in the technicals - a touch of levels to darken the darks would give it a bit more pop.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Perhaps a bit more of a close shot with good bokeh than an abstract.Do I like it?  Like the smile!Technicals?  About average in the technicals - a touch of levels to darken the darks would give it a bit more pop.', '2006-07-18 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634136, 363721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Not an abstract per se to me; more of a very intriguing setup shot using unique items as props.<br/>Do I like it?  The cheese bear(?) is quite cute and the use of crackers works well for the flooring.  What I can''t figure is what is on the moustrap - steel wool?  Hair?  And what is he hunting with what''s on the mousetrap?<br/>Technicals?  Pretty good.  I''m one of those people who actually likes shadows.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Not an abstract per se to me; more of a very intriguing setup shot using unique items as props.Do I like it?  The cheese bear(?) is quite cute and the use of crackers works well for the flooring.  What I can''t figure is what is on the moustrap - steel wool?  Hair?  And what is he hunting with what''s on the mousetrap?Technicals?  Pretty good.  I''m one of those people who actually likes shadows.', '2006-07-18 21:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634141, 364681, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Not really an abstract to me (but I''m not counting off for that, either.)<br/>Do I like it?  Yes, I rather like the post processing on this.  The composition works well, too.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Not really an abstract to me (but I''m not counting off for that, either.)Do I like it?  Yes, I rather like the post processing on this.  The composition works well, too.', '2006-07-18 21:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634149, 364906, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  I do like it, but it feels a bit cramped for some reason - seems I want to see a bit more to the right of the picture.<br/>Technicals?  I can''t find anything to suggest to improve on technicals.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  I do like it, but it feels a bit cramped for some reason - seems I want to see a bit more to the right of the picture.Technicals?  I can''t find anything to suggest to improve on technicals.', '2006-07-18 21:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634158, 362912, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes, but not sure where food comes into play.  I''ll assume it''s involved somehow.<br/>Do I like it?  It''s not bad, but it seems to lack cohesion - hard to explain, but it just doesn''t convey anything in particular to me as a viewer.<br/>Technicals?  Technicals seem to be fine to me.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes, but not sure where food comes into play.  I''ll assume it''s involved somehow.Do I like it?  It''s not bad, but it seems to lack cohesion - hard to explain, but it just doesn''t convey anything in particular to me as a viewer.Technicals?  Technicals seem to be fine to me.', '2006-07-18 21:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634167, 364907, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  It''s a bit too centered for my taste, I think.  <br/>Technicals?  A bit weak - I''d expect the focus to be very sharp for a flat cut like this, and the contrast is a bit flat to me.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  It''s a bit too centered for my taste, I think.  Technicals?  A bit weak - I''d expect the focus to be very sharp for a flat cut like this, and the contrast is a bit flat to me.', '2006-07-18 21:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634177, 364555, 19178, '<td valign="top">Very appealing colors.</td>', 'Very appealing colors.', '2006-07-18 21:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634178, 364639, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Eh, not sure on this one.  More of a creative use of a prop, but I''m not deducting for "not abstract".<br/>Do I like it?  The banana itself rather than the heart seems to be the focus - perhaps a slightly different composition to emphasize the heart - less of the banana, more of the heart?<br/>Technicals?  A little bright/harsh with the light, but not too bad.  A red background might have accentuated your title a bit more.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Eh, not sure on this one.  More of a creative use of a prop, but I''m not deducting for "not abstract".Do I like it?  The banana itself rather than the heart seems to be the focus - perhaps a slightly different composition to emphasize the heart - less of the banana, more of the heart?Technicals?  A little bright/harsh with the light, but not too bad.  A red background might have accentuated your title a bit more.', '2006-07-18 21:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634180, 362908, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sorry - this has nothing to do with the challenge whatsoever.  I suspect you''re getting very low scores because of this.</td>', 'Sorry - this has nothing to do with the challenge whatsoever.  I suspect you''re getting very low scores because of this.', '2006-07-18 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634184, 363722, 19178, '<td valign="top">Good realization of this idea.  The focus seems to be a bit off if you think <br/>the tips should be sharp.</td>', 'Good realization of this idea.  The focus seems to be a bit off if you think the tips should be sharp.', '2006-07-18 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634187, 362978, 19178, '<td valign="top">Interesting arrangement of forms in this image.</td>', 'Interesting arrangement of forms in this image.', '2006-07-18 21:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634193, 362043, 19178, '<td valign="top">This image seems to be a bit underexposed and a bit out of focus.  It also seems to be more of a still life than an abstract.  However, the composition is pretty nicely balanced.</td>', 'This image seems to be a bit underexposed and a bit out of focus.  It also seems to be more of a still life than an abstract.  However, the composition is pretty nicely balanced.', '2006-07-18 21:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634197, 364718, 19178, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2006-07-18 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634202, 363218, 19178, '<td valign="top">This is a striking composition.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This is a striking composition.  Nicely done!', '2006-07-18 21:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634205, 364499, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yep, definitely.<br/>Do I like it?  I do like the basic simplicity - works well as an abstract<br/>Technicals?  The only thing that bothers me is the lack of depth/texture/detail on the black side of the ridges - would have liked to see the same shadowing you have on the blue side.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yep, definitely.Do I like it?  I do like the basic simplicity - works well as an abstractTechnicals?  The only thing that bothers me is the lack of depth/texture/detail on the black side of the ridges - would have liked to see the same shadowing you have on the blue side.', '2006-07-18 21:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634212, 364697, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  Well, not really.  Even with abstracts, there should be a "focus" or an impression you''re conveying to the viewer - I''m not seeing anything cohesive here, but abstracts are often viewed very differently by different people.<br/>Technicals?  Colors are interesting, but the bright white parts detract for me.  I think, for me anyway, it might have worked better with less of the blown white blobs and more of the color sections.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  Well, not really.  Even with abstracts, there should be a "focus" or an impression you''re conveying to the viewer - I''m not seeing anything cohesive here, but abstracts are often viewed very differently by different people.Technicals?  Colors are interesting, but the bright white parts detract for me.  I think, for me anyway, it might have worked better with less of the blown white blobs and more of the color sections.', '2006-07-18 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634215, 364781, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  This one does not appeal to me personally, but abstracts appeal to different people very differently.<br/>Technicals?  The very dark spot is what draws my attention first - then the gold section.  The swirling pattern kind of keeps you in the picture.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  This one does not appeal to me personally, but abstracts appeal to different people very differently.Technicals?  The very dark spot is what draws my attention first - then the gold section.  The swirling pattern kind of keeps you in the picture.', '2006-07-18 21:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634237, 363248, 42100, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of time spent pick out just the right peppers and arranging them for this photo.  Very clever idea and well executed.</td>', 'That''s a lot of time spent pick out just the right peppers and arranging them for this photo.  Very clever idea and well executed.', '2006-07-18 22:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634246, 362202, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great composition and very good use of DOF.  Some more dynamic lighting would really push this over the top.</td>', 'Great composition and very good use of DOF.  Some more dynamic lighting would really push this over the top.', '2006-07-18 22:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634258, 364497, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool jello macro, best one of the challenge ;P  The color and light are very interesting.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool jello macro, best one of the challenge ;P  The color and light are very interesting.  Nicely done!', '2006-07-18 22:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634266, 364917, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail.  Arrangement of these grains make an interesting abstract with lots of texture.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great lighting and detail.  Arrangement of these grains make an interesting abstract with lots of texture.  Very nice!', '2006-07-18 22:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634273, 362610, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that this is garlic because of the title, otherwise I wouldn''t have any idea.  A very interesting leading line that pulls you right into the photo.  Good use of DOF as well.  Well done!</td>', 'I''m guessing that this is garlic because of the title, otherwise I wouldn''t have any idea.  A very interesting leading line that pulls you right into the photo.  Good use of DOF as well.  Well done!', '2006-07-18 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634321, 363697, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  Yeah, kinda!<br/>Technicals?  I think I''d like to see it with a bit more light on the top apple, or perhaps the top apple just a little less soft, but still not focused.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  Yeah, kinda!Technicals?  I think I''d like to see it with a bit more light on the top apple, or perhaps the top apple just a little less soft, but still not focused.', '2006-07-18 22:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634324, 362736, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  Yeah, it''s kinda cool.<br/>Technicals?  What makes this interesting is the lighting - very intriguing because of that.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  Yeah, it''s kinda cool.Technicals?  What makes this interesting is the lighting - very intriguing because of that.', '2006-07-18 22:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634334, 364624, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Not really - this is really more literal to me.<br/>Do I like it?  I do like the steam and the lighting.<br/>Technicals?  The glow the lighting creates on the potato is good.  The fork out of focus bothers me a bit since this is more of a literal shot.  <br/>A closer view of just one side of the potato (preferably the glowy part) and the steam would have been more of an abstract.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Not really - this is really more literal to me.Do I like it?  I do like the steam and the lighting.Technicals?  The glow the lighting creates on the potato is good.  The fork out of focus bothers me a bit since this is more of a literal shot.  A closer view of just one side of the potato (preferably the glowy part) and the steam would have been more of an abstract.', '2006-07-18 22:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634342, 364829, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes<br/>Do I like it?  Yeah, this works well.  I like the granular texture and the colors.  Gummy worms?<br/>Technicals?  Good.  Could be a bit crisper across the bolder colors.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  YesDo I like it?  Yeah, this works well.  I like the granular texture and the colors.  Gummy worms?Technicals?  Good.  Could be a bit crisper across the bolder colors.', '2006-07-18 22:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634349, 363060, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes.  This works well as an abstract and is still mostly recognizable - would have taken me a minute to figure it was a strawberry.<br/>Do I like it?  Yes.  <br/>Technicals?  Composition is very good; good use of color and the diagonal corner.  Also very good use of DOF.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Yes.  This works well as an abstract and is still mostly recognizable - would have taken me a minute to figure it was a strawberry.Do I like it?  Yes.  Technicals?  Composition is very good; good use of color and the diagonal corner.  Also very good use of DOF.', '2006-07-18 22:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2634356, 364246, 30982, '<td valign="top">Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Very much so.<br/>Do I like it?  Yes.  Haven''t a clue what it is, and that doesn''t bother me at all.<br/>Technicals?  Very nice!  Excellent composition, nice contrasts of clear, sharp focus on the stem and softness on the body of whatever it is.  Bokeh adds nicely, and I love the touch of blue at the bottom.</td>', 'Abstract as I perceive abstract?  Very much so.Do I like it?  Yes.  Haven''t a clue what it is, and that doesn''t bother me at all.Technicals?  Very nice!  Excellent composition, nice contrasts of clear, sharp focus on the stem and softness on the body of whatever it is.  Bokeh adds nicely, and I love the touch of blue at the bottom.', '2006-07-18 22:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
