(2641514, 364526, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Nice colour and composition. Focus could have been a bit sharper on the cherry, and it might not be abstract enough to meet the challenge perfectly. But a decent photo overall.</td>', 'Interesting image. Nice colour and composition. Focus could have been a bit sharper on the cherry, and it might not be abstract enough to meet the challenge perfectly. But a decent photo overall.', '2006-07-20 06:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641521, 364114, 46314, '<td valign="top">You might not like what I have to say here, but I think it''s too abstract. I know that sounds silly in an abstract challenge, but what I mean is that by shooting it so abstract, all you''ve really got in the frame is a range of green tones. It would look cool as a tiled wallpaper, but it''s just not very interesting as a single image. It''s not bad or ugly, it''s just not that stunning either.</td>', 'You might not like what I have to say here, but I think it''s too abstract. I know that sounds silly in an abstract challenge, but what I mean is that by shooting it so abstract, all you''ve really got in the frame is a range of green tones. It would look cool as a tiled wallpaper, but it''s just not very interesting as a single image. It''s not bad or ugly, it''s just not that stunning either.', '2006-07-20 06:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2641524, 364800, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very funny. And very neatly taken. Not sure if it meets the abstract food challenge perfectly, but certainly has abstract humour...</td>', 'Very funny. And very neatly taken. Not sure if it meets the abstract food challenge perfectly, but certainly has abstract humour...', '2006-07-20 06:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
