(2643079, 364419, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little bit too thin on DOF IMO.  Some interesting color contrasts in here however.  Good luck.</td>', 'A little bit too thin on DOF IMO.  Some interesting color contrasts in here however.  Good luck.', '2006-07-20 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2643082, 364592, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I''d rather have the image do the talking instead of the title.  Concerning the image, it would have helped to use some bounced light coming from the bottom right to eliminate the shadows some.  The yellow paper could pop a bit more too with better lighting and/or exposure.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute, but I''d rather have the image do the talking instead of the title.  Concerning the image, it would have helped to use some bounced light coming from the bottom right to eliminate the shadows some.  The yellow paper could pop a bit more too with better lighting and/or exposure.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-20 16:57:04.000000', NULL, 1);
