(2644600, 364608, 25378, '<td valign="top">First of all, this image could have a lot of potential. It looks like you tried lens movement during the exposure, but neither the small nor large glasses are very well focused. You could try using a tripod to minimize motion blur or move the lens slower and steadier. Also, the reflections are really distracting and annoying. A white sheet behind you might get rid of them. And the bright red background doesn''t really do anything for the image in my opinion. Maybe just a plain white one so the red cherry really stands out? I hope I helped!</td>', 'First of all, this image could have a lot of potential. It looks like you tried lens movement during the exposure, but neither the small nor large glasses are very well focused. You could try using a tripod to minimize motion blur or move the lens slower and steadier. Also, the reflections are really distracting and annoying. A white sheet behind you might get rid of them. And the bright red background doesn''t really do anything for the image in my opinion. Maybe just a plain white one so the red cherry really stands out? I hope I helped!', '2006-07-20 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2644601, 364422, 37893, '<td valign="top">Superb macro. Love the textures here.</td>', 'Superb macro. Love the textures here.', '2006-07-20 23:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
