(2644628, 364741, 25378, '<td valign="top">It looks like you used a flash on a white tabletop or something, and the image isn''t very well focused. I like how you arranged the food though, and I think the picture could be very nice if you didn''t shoot from straight above and maybe tried some diffuse lighting.</td>', 'It looks like you used a flash on a white tabletop or something, and the image isn''t very well focused. I like how you arranged the food though, and I think the picture could be very nice if you didn''t shoot from straight above and maybe tried some diffuse lighting.', '2006-07-20 23:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2644637, 364739, 25378, '<td valign="top">Not very appealing, is it oil in water? There really isn''t one focal point. I keep jumping back and forth between the reddish blob and the black one, and the splash of red in the background doesn''t really help. I would try to make the image simpler with the blobs more defined. The colors look kind of artificial, too.</td>', 'Not very appealing, is it oil in water? There really isn''t one focal point. I keep jumping back and forth between the reddish blob and the black one, and the splash of red in the background doesn''t really help. I would try to make the image simpler with the blobs more defined. The colors look kind of artificial, too.', '2006-07-20 23:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2644650, 364221, 25378, '<td valign="top">Wow! Awesome! I love the contrast between the blue and yellow and the perfectly spherical drops. The detail in the fruit adds some interest to the picture. Top ten definitely. The only thing I don''t like about this pic is the neat-imaged look to it. I''d tone down on the neat-imaging.</td>', 'Wow! Awesome! I love the contrast between the blue and yellow and the perfectly spherical drops. The detail in the fruit adds some interest to the picture. Top ten definitely. The only thing I don''t like about this pic is the neat-imaged look to it. I''d tone down on the neat-imaging.', '2006-07-20 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
