(2645811, 364848, 61234, '<td valign="top">This is great. An excellent mind at work here. A top pick for sure, at least in my humble opinion. Going into my favorites :)</td>', 'This is great. An excellent mind at work here. A top pick for sure, at least in my humble opinion. Going into my favorites :)', '2006-07-21 10:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
