(2647495, 364733, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Has an almost alien like feel to it. The color and focus are excellent. Maybe a bit more macro than abstract but I didnt let that affect my vote. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Has an almost alien like feel to it. The color and focus are excellent. Maybe a bit more macro than abstract but I didnt let that affect my vote. Bumping up.', '2006-07-21 22:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2647498, 362451, 53147, '<td valign="top">The patterns of the cabbage work really well, but the green is just a bit overboard. Perosnally would have preferred the white over the green. Very good idea though.</td>', 'The patterns of the cabbage work really well, but the green is just a bit overboard. Perosnally would have preferred the white over the green. Very good idea though.', '2006-07-21 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2647499, 363697, 37893, '<td valign="top">This definitely an abstract image reminds me of Nshapiro''s style but lacks the vibrance of the colors. I believe this might suffer from being too abstract for most of DPCs tastes.</td>', 'This definitely an abstract image reminds me of Nshapiro''s style but lacks the vibrance of the colors. I believe this might suffer from being too abstract for most of DPCs tastes.', '2006-07-21 22:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2647505, 363170, 53147, '<td valign="top">The other cabbage shots I wanted more white rather than the colors they showed, but this one is a bit to obright for me. Makes the shot a bit soft overall. Good idea though and it fits the challenge well.</td>', 'The other cabbage shots I wanted more white rather than the colors they showed, but this one is a bit to obright for me. Makes the shot a bit soft overall. Good idea though and it fits the challenge well.', '2006-07-21 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2647506, 364695, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry and balance. The horizon seems just a tad tilted to the left but it could very well be just an optical illusion. This ime is clean and sharp and should do quite well in this challenge. Not as abstract as most poeple would probably think of but the mirrored reflection creates this illusion. Great job!</td>', 'Great symmetry and balance. The horizon seems just a tad tilted to the left but it could very well be just an optical illusion. This ime is clean and sharp and should do quite well in this challenge. Not as abstract as most poeple would probably think of but the mirrored reflection creates this illusion. Great job!', '2006-07-21 22:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2647509, 362916, 53147, '<td valign="top">Not much of an abstract but  aniec shot none theless. I didnt let that affect my vote. Good colors and lighting but the area in focus is just a bit too thin IMO.</td>', 'Not much of an abstract but  aniec shot none theless. I didnt let that affect my vote. Good colors and lighting but the area in focus is just a bit too thin IMO.', '2006-07-21 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
