(2647515, 364922, 53147, '<td valign="top">On first vote run through I gave this a 6 as I felt it was not abstract enough. Now looking back at my votes I am deciding to bump this up one. The colors are great and the detail is sharp. A very nice macro shot.</td>', 'On first vote run through I gave this a 6 as I felt it was not abstract enough. Now looking back at my votes I am deciding to bump this up one. The colors are great and the detail is sharp. A very nice macro shot.', '2006-07-21 22:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
