(2647553, 364487, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great colors and such a dynamic feel for this image. Very shapiro-like with the use of the zoom. The tilt of the color line creates movement and rhythm in this shot. Not typical of DPC images though so I think this will score pretty much on average. good luck and bumping up.</td>', 'Great colors and such a dynamic feel for this image. Very shapiro-like with the use of the zoom. The tilt of the color line creates movement and rhythm in this shot. Not typical of DPC images though so I think this will score pretty much on average. good luck and bumping up.', '2006-07-21 22:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
