(2649770, 364819, 38032, '<td valign="top">... hu hu ...   OK ... I''m gonna be critical so just take it as if I''m trying to help because i am ! :]  He might not be seen due to the following constructive reasons:  He is out of focus.  He is not quite centered but even if he is, the angle and POV and background are not overly interesting or clean.  He is raw lumps of meat or something which is very hard to make look appealing.  He is not really abstract IMO.  The white balance appears to be a little off.  Having said that, it actually made me hungry for some reason.  I''m going to eat.  Keep shooting!</td>', '... hu hu ...   OK ... I''m gonna be critical so just take it as if I''m trying to help because i am ! :]  He might not be seen due to the following constructive reasons:  He is out of focus.  He is not quite centered but even if he is, the angle and POV and background are not overly interesting or clean.  He is raw lumps of meat or something which is very hard to make look appealing.  He is not really abstract IMO.  The white balance appears to be a little off.  Having said that, it actually made me hungry for some reason.  I''m going to eat.  Keep shooting!', '2006-07-22 20:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
