(2651775, 364833, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice non macro shot. Great idea intersecting the yellow(pasta) and blue(window blinds?) lines. Abstract all the way. Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice non macro shot. Great idea intersecting the yellow(pasta) and blue(window blinds?) lines. Abstract all the way. Great shot.', '2006-07-23 18:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651780, 364668, 29011, '<td valign="top">Bumping up. Great idea which was very nicely executed. I see it as a surrealistic abstract.</td>', 'Bumping up. Great idea which was very nicely executed. I see it as a surrealistic abstract.', '2006-07-23 18:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651784, 363146, 49889, '<td valign="top">never saw a erotic Tortellini ;-)</td>', 'never saw a erotic Tortellini ;-)', '2006-07-23 18:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651791, 364877, 29011, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot overall but with the focus as such, I think it takes away from the abstract feel of it. Would''ve been more abstract in shape without the spoon as such, maybe if there where spoons coming out/in of the four corners. Perhaps then the symmetry would''ve helped this become more akin to the challenge? great shot though.</td>', 'A really nice shot overall but with the focus as such, I think it takes away from the abstract feel of it. Would''ve been more abstract in shape without the spoon as such, maybe if there where spoons coming out/in of the four corners. Perhaps then the symmetry would''ve helped this become more akin to the challenge? great shot though.', '2006-07-23 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651798, 364638, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and sharpe. Love it. 10</td>', 'Beautiful color and sharpe. Love it. 10', '2006-07-23 19:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651801, 364604, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2006-07-23 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651804, 364807, 29011, '<td valign="top">This image has very good lighting. Perhaps going a bit further to add some highlights to the knife because seeing only the banana reflection alone is somewhat strange at first glance. I do see some the handle reflection though, but it''s not easy to see it.</td>', 'This image has very good lighting. Perhaps going a bit further to add some highlights to the knife because seeing only the banana reflection alone is somewhat strange at first glance. I do see some the handle reflection though, but it''s not easy to see it.', '2006-07-23 19:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651806, 364497, 33947, '<td valign="top">Sharp, nicely lit, rich color. Like it. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Sharp, nicely lit, rich color. Like it. One of my favorites.', '2006-07-23 19:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651808, 363756, 29011, '<td valign="top">Without reading the title , this reminded me of a bird''s beak.<br/>This one has the most delectable props of the challenge. Yummm :)</td>', 'Without reading the title , this reminded me of a bird''s beak.This one has the most delectable props of the challenge. Yummm :)', '2006-07-23 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
