(2651948, 364922, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like this. Very pretty capture of the the purple/blue hues. Good light and capture of detail. This has very painting like look to it.</td>', 'Really like this. Very pretty capture of the the purple/blue hues. Good light and capture of detail. This has very painting like look to it.', '2006-07-23 20:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651950, 362916, 29011, '<td valign="top">Fun word play on thte title. Very nicely composed image. Wouldn''t mind a little more DOF though. Still, great shot! good luck :)</td>', 'Fun word play on thte title. Very nicely composed image. Wouldn''t mind a little more DOF though. Still, great shot! good luck :)', '2006-07-23 20:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651953, 364861, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice minimalistic abstract. The negative space works well here and very nice choice of colors. This has a good fresh pop to it!</td>', 'Very nice minimalistic abstract. The negative space works well here and very nice choice of colors. This has a good fresh pop to it!', '2006-07-23 20:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651957, 362736, 29011, '<td valign="top">wow! I can see it. Grea shot :)<br/>Wouldn''t have guessed this was a peach.</td>', 'wow! I can see it. Grea shot :)Wouldn''t have guessed this was a peach.', '2006-07-23 20:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651959, 364733, 29011, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sci fi world. Great macro!</td>', 'Looks like a sci fi world. Great macro!', '2006-07-23 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651969, 364499, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines and awesome contrast. Would''ve looked even cleaner if the yellow spots near the black tooth shaped edges where dodged but it depends on what look you where going for and this works just as well. Very much interested in how this image was created :)</td>', 'Nice clean lines and awesome contrast. Would''ve looked even cleaner if the yellow spots near the black tooth shaped edges where dodged but it depends on what look you where going for and this works just as well. Very much interested in how this image was created :)', '2006-07-23 20:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651972, 364411, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. I really like the play with texture here. One minor nitpick would be the 11 o''clock section of the bread. The edge isn''t as neatly burnt out as the rest.</td>', 'Very good shot. I really like the play with texture here. One minor nitpick would be the 11 o''clock section of the bread. The edge isn''t as neatly burnt out as the rest.', '2006-07-23 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651975, 364634, 29011, '<td valign="top">A nice clean shot. Not exactly an Abstract per se, but I guess it depends on how you look at it. Perhaps a closer up view of the mix of greens, whites and reds would''ve worked better for this challenge.</td>', 'A nice clean shot. Not exactly an Abstract per se, but I guess it depends on how you look at it. Perhaps a closer up view of the mix of greens, whites and reds would''ve worked better for this challenge.', '2006-07-23 20:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651976, 364424, 29011, '<td valign="top">A really good macro. Clean, sharp and full of detail. Perhaps I would''ve preferred a cool pink hue but this blue sure does make it even more abstract.</td>', 'A really good macro. Clean, sharp and full of detail. Perhaps I would''ve preferred a cool pink hue but this blue sure does make it even more abstract.', '2006-07-23 20:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651979, 364723, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is a nice twist. Tim, is that you? :)<br/>In any case, it reminds me of Tim''s photo.  //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=326943</td>', 'This is a nice twist. Tim, is that you? :)In any case, it reminds me of Tim''s photo.  //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=326943', '2006-07-23 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651984, 364070, 29011, '<td valign="top">hmm, Food? looks like a grater of some sort. I''ll be interested to see if you have extra comments to sure? In any case, this is nicely done :)</td>', 'hmm, Food? looks like a grater of some sort. I''ll be interested to see if you have extra comments to sure? In any case, this is nicely done :)', '2006-07-23 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651987, 363994, 29011, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, a severe case of Pepper mouth ;) looks like two aliens having a go at each other.</td>', 'Oh yeah, a severe case of Pepper mouth ;) looks like two aliens having a go at each other.', '2006-07-23 20:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651988, 363218, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines, contrast and the choice of red for the background. Great job!</td>', 'Very nice lines, contrast and the choice of red for the background. Great job!', '2006-07-23 21:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651992, 362401, 29011, '<td valign="top">The way the strands of pasta disappear into the darkness, Great lighting here. Nicely composed as well.</td>', 'The way the strands of pasta disappear into the darkness, Great lighting here. Nicely composed as well.', '2006-07-23 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2651999, 364762, 29011, '<td valign="top">This challenge needs more Peaches :)<br/>Would''ve like the image to be somewhat sharper and a simple black frame. I find the current frame is a bit odd.</td>', 'This challenge needs more Peaches :)Would''ve like the image to be somewhat sharper and a simple black frame. I find the current frame is a bit odd.', '2006-07-23 21:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2652005, 364592, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s abstract enough alright. Great idea. The lighting seems to be coming from the side which produces those side shadows. Think I would''ve liked it better with the light shining in from the top? so no shadows and should''ve revealed less of the paper texture.</td>', 'It''s abstract enough alright. Great idea. The lighting seems to be coming from the side which produces those side shadows. Think I would''ve liked it better with the light shining in from the top? so no shadows and should''ve revealed less of the paper texture.', '2006-07-23 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1);
