(2652481, 364926, 38032, '<td valign="top">wow this took me a while - I don''t usually like corny  refraction  images but this has a bizarre alien feeling to it that puts it over the top.  It''s different from any others that i''ve seen by far.  The light is great and the reflected background makes it look like some sort of organic pod or something.  well done.  9</td>', 'wow this took me a while - I don''t usually like corny  refraction  images but this has a bizarre alien feeling to it that puts it over the top.  It''s different from any others that i''ve seen by far.  The light is great and the reflected background makes it look like some sort of organic pod or something.  well done.  9', '2006-07-24 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
