(2653913, 362934, 23458, '<td valign="top">These ice shots can be hard to do effectively - so a nice attempt here. I like the way you have arranged the fruit. Perhaps the lighting is a bit flat/the colours not quite vibrant enough for this to do spectacularly, but overall I think it''s quite an effective shot. I gave your shot a six.</td>', 'These ice shots can be hard to do effectively - so a nice attempt here. I like the way you have arranged the fruit. Perhaps the lighting is a bit flat/the colours not quite vibrant enough for this to do spectacularly, but overall I think it''s quite an effective shot. I gave your shot a six.', '2006-07-24 06:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
