(2654044, 362610, 53147, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top ten finish. I had an "oh man" moment when I saw that we tied and then that I had bumped you up on my vote the other day. LOL - I gave away my little star. But I wouldnt change it back even knowing what I know now. I thought yours was a great shot and well deserving of top ten (you should have been a bit higher personally). Great shot and congrats!</td>', 'Congrats on your top ten finish. I had an "oh man" moment when I saw that we tied and then that I had bumped you up on my vote the other day. LOL - I gave away my little star. But I wouldnt change it back even knowing what I know now. I thought yours was a great shot and well deserving of top ten (you should have been a bit higher personally). Great shot and congrats!', '2006-07-24 08:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2654054, 364497, 48680, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon!  very creative &amp; abstract, really like how the colours blend in to one another.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon!  very creative & abstract, really like how the colours blend in to one another.', '2006-07-24 08:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
