(2655726, 363248, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Liked the use of colors and the pattern created.  Re your title, honestly only after reviewing it and reading your notes, do I now ''get'' what you were aiming for - but might just be me, good any way.  Would like to have seen a little softer light overall, otherwise perhaps not a white background - just seems a bit ''bright''.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Liked the use of colors and the pattern created.  Re your title, honestly only after reviewing it and reading your notes, do I now ''get'' what you were aiming for - but might just be me, good any way.  Would like to have seen a little softer light overall, otherwise perhaps not a white background - just seems a bit ''bright''.', '2006-07-24 16:51:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2655734, 364541, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Whilst obviously a mushroom, the ''use'' of it via this ''scene'' (which I realized during voting was likely difficult), created something unusual, which I liked.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Whilst obviously a mushroom, the ''use'' of it via this ''scene'' (which I realized during voting was likely difficult), created something unusual, which I liked.', '2006-07-24 16:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
