(2655740, 364896, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Really liked the colors/patterns/shapes used, as well as the unusual ''placement''.  The ''high key'' effect works well, but just a <i>fraction</i> more definition, may have made this even better in my opinion... but I''m sure this looks exactly as you intended.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Really liked the colors/patterns/shapes used, as well as the unusual ''placement''.  The ''high key'' effect works well, but just a fraction more definition, may have made this even better in my opinion... but I''m sure this looks exactly as you intended.', '2006-07-24 16:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
