(2657882, 364922, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dahkota:</b></div><hr/><i>Makes me think I should really just stay at home and shoot things in my lightbox for every challenge. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Nah...don''t want to do that.  You''d get bored!  ;^)<br/> <br/>Congrats on a fantastic finish with this entry.  Most people don''t realize how much texture and character a blueberry can have.  You''ve captured the hidden beauty of this simple fruit, and in a hurry as well.  Showoff!  He-he.  Well, I hope you at least had to agonize over the crop.<br/> <br/>Hey.  When did you get the 30D?  Last time I saw you you were carrying the Rebel.<br/> <br/>Smile and keep having fun!<br/>Barry<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by dahkota:Makes me think I should really just stay at home and shoot things in my lightbox for every challenge. ;)  Nah...don''t want to do that.  You''d get bored!  ;^) Congrats on a fantastic finish with this entry.  Most people don''t realize how much texture and character a blueberry can have.  You''ve captured the hidden beauty of this simple fruit, and in a hurry as well.  Showoff!  He-he.  Well, I hope you at least had to agonize over the crop. Hey.  When did you get the 30D?  Last time I saw you you were carrying the Rebel. Smile and keep having fun!Barry ', '2006-07-25 10:07:24.000000', NULL, 0),
