(2662222, 364858, 57229, '<td valign="top">Does this leave the good ship suck without a captain?<br/> <br/>It''s a canvas of a shot - all those things like cropping and balance-within-the-frame and such that I prefer to see than name, are seen and don''t need to be named.<br/> <br/>This should not have succeeded here as there are # no large fields of primary colour # no hyper-saturation # no unbroken areas without texture to set off the subject. There''s hope for us yet.<br/> <br/>You might say the understatement sets it off.<br/> <br/>Well did.</td>', 'Does this leave the good ship suck without a captain? It''s a canvas of a shot - all those things like cropping and balance-within-the-frame and such that I prefer to see than name, are seen and don''t need to be named. This should not have succeeded here as there are # no large fields of primary colour # no hyper-saturation # no unbroken areas without texture to set off the subject. There''s hope for us yet. You might say the understatement sets it off. Well did.', '2006-07-26 07:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
