(2664296, 364858, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by raish:</b></div><hr/><i>This should not have succeeded here</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>my thought exactly! perhaps it being an abstract challenge made voters more tolerant of the lack of a subject, the flatness, etc. Then again, I''ve been known to bomb in abstract challenges as well. I have no clue why this made top 20. That''s why I can still suck!</td>', 'Originally posted by raish:This should not have succeeded here  my thought exactly! perhaps it being an abstract challenge made voters more tolerant of the lack of a subject, the flatness, etc. Then again, I''ve been known to bomb in abstract challenges as well. I have no clue why this made top 20. That''s why I can still suck!', '2006-07-26 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
