(2665628, 364409, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>At first glance, I didn''t realize the outer segments were orange sections as well.  The desaturation is well done, though I almost think I''d like to see the outer segments partially desaturated - maybe from where they touch the single orange segment have them desaturated as you go out toward the edge of the picture, as though the single segment is sucking the color from the others.  I thought it worked well as an abstract.</td>', 'Trading Post comment At first glance, I didn''t realize the outer segments were orange sections as well.  The desaturation is well done, though I almost think I''d like to see the outer segments partially desaturated - maybe from where they touch the single orange segment have them desaturated as you go out toward the edge of the picture, as though the single segment is sucking the color from the others.  I thought it worked well as an abstract.', '2006-07-26 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2665703, 363218, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>Congrats on the top ten!  You''re just a DPC machine these days... :-)  Very clean and crisp, good color contrast, and a pleasing geometric image.  Good job slicing the cucumbers as well.  Great shot for the challenge, but from a photography perspective, I much prefer the one you didn''t enter.</td>', 'Trading Post comment Congrats on the top ten!  You''re just a DPC machine these days... :-)  Very clean and crisp, good color contrast, and a pleasing geometric image.  Good job slicing the cucumbers as well.  Great shot for the challenge, but from a photography perspective, I much prefer the one you didn''t enter.', '2006-07-26 21:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
