(2863682, 364858, 48890, '<td valign="top">The more still lifes I see, the more respect I have for film photography.  I think that, if this were shot with film, the top and bottom left corners would have retained lots of interesting semi tones.  Check this out, for example: <a href="//www.photosight.ru/photo.php?photoid=991824&amp;ref=author" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.photosight.ru/photo.php?photoid=991824&amp;ref=author</a></td>', 'The more still lifes I see, the more respect I have for film photography.  I think that, if this were shot with film, the top and bottom left corners would have retained lots of interesting semi tones.  Check this out, for example: //www.photosight.ru/photo.php?photoid=991824&ref=author', '2006-09-25 16:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
