(2907335, 364858, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow.  A piece of wood and the skin of an onion.  With the skill of the masters, you managed to remove the mundane and let your artistry unfold into a perfectly blended world of crisp detail, texture, lines and color.  Somehow this image brings to my mind the painting of Van Gogh''s boot...the simple and mundane transformed into timeless art.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Wow.  A piece of wood and the skin of an onion.  With the skill of the masters, you managed to remove the mundane and let your artistry unfold into a perfectly blended world of crisp detail, texture, lines and color.  Somehow this image brings to my mind the painting of Van Gogh''s boot...the simple and mundane transformed into timeless art.  Beautiful!', '2006-10-08 03:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
